  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.23 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.38 (accurate WebGPU/WebGL log, a WGSL short-circuit fix, kernels that call an unimplementable method now fail to compile instead of computing zeros, MathF.Log2 and friends in kernels, its kernel-launch marshalling rewritten for browser AOT). Browser AOT: the generated GPU kernels ship in their own assembly inside this package (SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML.Kernels.dll) and the package's buildTransitive targets leave it to the interpreter (they were 83% of the library's 58-minute AOT compile; opt out with SpawnDevMLAotKernels=true). LTX-2: in-place image to video (Ltx2Guide.InPlace, ComfyUI's LTXVImgToVideoInplace), page-locked block uploads on CUDA (upload 5.8 -> 4.5 s a call), and the ComfyUI-compatible fp8 LoRA rounding exact to ComfyUI's half-precision arithmetic (every fp8 tensor of every block: equal but for float32 summation-order ties). Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
